{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1274224-isbn-numbers","id":1274224,"title":"ISBN Numbers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-13T11:28:37-08:00","id":1274224,"title":"ISBN Numbers","content":"I use an app to keep track of all my books and it tracks them by ISBN number. i cannot find ISBN numbers for a few OPP books. Do they not have them? I need the following:<br /> <br /> Mage the Ascension 20th Anniversary Edition - Black cover<br /> Beckett's Jyhad Diary<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-13T17:06:53-08:00","id":1274272,"title":"","content":"ISBN numbers are typically required when you're selling something in a retail space. Most OPP products are sold via DriveThruRPG or Kickstarter, so there was no need to purchase an ISBN for them.<br /> <br /> Some of our recent Kickstarters -- Scarred Lands, Prince's Gambit, Pugmire, etc. -- have been done with an eye to getting a traditional print run for stores, so those products typically have ISBNs attached.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-13T18:16:28-08:00","id":1274290,"title":"","content":"TIL: You have to buy ISBNs.<br /> <br /> Looks kind of expensive if you're a small publisher, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T05:26:18-08:00","id":1274347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1274224-isbn-numbers?p=1274272#post1274272\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ISBN numbers are typically required when you're selling something in a retail space. Most OPP products are sold via DriveThruRPG or Kickstarter, so there was no need to purchase an ISBN for them.<br /> <br /> Some of our recent Kickstarters -- Scarred Lands, Prince's Gambit, Pugmire, etc. -- have been done with an eye to getting a traditional print run for stores, so those products typically have ISBNs attached.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah. Thanks, Ian. I'll have to add them manually.","signatu